{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"メルマガ会員のみなさん\n私からのメールは届きましたか？\nデコメ使えなくて顔文字迷ったんだ。\n（＾ω＾）←この子お気に入りなの笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うへへ（＾ω＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、ちなみに普段からあまり\nメールしない方なので適当と\n思われがちです。\n...適当じゃないです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雪降ったみたいだけど、\nそんなでもなかったみたいだね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"別に雪に喜んでないし！\nすぐ溶けたし！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......\n昨日はリハーサル"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今月はライブもあるし忙しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/07/0514446/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/07/0514446/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*****HaPPy BirThDAy*****"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみ♡2013.2.6"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみになめられてる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/07/0514446/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもかわいいからなあ...\nみなみならなんでも\n許せちゃうんだよなあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/07/0514446/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いちばんかわいいツンデレ\nしてくるのよね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暇なときはいっつもおしゃべりしよー\nって言ってくるからしゃべって\nあげてるんだよ。まったく\n私はみなみのお姉さん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/07/0514446/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/07/0514446/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみのテキトーなところも\nツンデレなところもだいすきです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆☆☆\n平成24年度ものづくり立国\n「10,000人の夢王国」に\nみくも、ゆったん、まりかの3人が\nゲスト出演する事になりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ものづくり...興奮する"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/07/0514446/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/07/0514446/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/07/0514446/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆☆☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/07/0514446/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では今日もがんばりまりか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}